ea0e42c193e92329.mp4?t=1733165953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Help Yui resist the pleasures of the punishments she'll receive after being captured by the Pharaoh and her obedient lackeys - Or don't, if you want Yui to succumb. But it'll be Game Over for you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT THE SANITY OF PAST ADVENTURES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2243330/extras/003e9a1fdb8b5f25530c4b7e83cb3ef0.poster.avif?t=1733165953\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2243330/extras/003e9a1fdb8b5f25530c4b7e83cb3ef0.webm?t=1733165953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2243330/extras/003e9a1fdb8b5f25530c4b7e83cb3ef0.mp4?t=1733165953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Just reaching the exit isn't enough - Throughout the levels are floating orbs containing the sanity of past adventurers. Collecting half of them opens the exit door, so you'll be required to take risks! Plus, if you can collect and hold onto them, you may be in for a reward!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WITNESS THE KINKY MEMORIES OF OTHERS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2243330/extras/642c20054ef4ad25060a8f303f4a005e.poster.avif?t=1733165953\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2243330/extras/642c20054ef4ad25060a8f303f4a005e.webm?t=1733165953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2243330/extras/642c20054ef4ad25060a8f303f4a005e.mp4?t=1733165953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Find and interact with beautiful ladies that came before you and are now enjoying their new immortal lives as the Pharaoh's playthings. Give them some of their sanity back and witness their last punishment before succumbing to the Pharaoh.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OUT-HOP THE PHAROAH AND HER LACKEYS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2243330/extras/d8ab83d93054415afa43e6b48ed07171.poster.avif?t=1733165953\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2243330/extras/d8ab83d93054415afa43e6b48ed07171.webm?t=1733165953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2243330/extras/d8ab83d93054415afa43e6b48ed07171.mp4?t=1733165953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Near the end of each chapter you'll be confronted by the ruler of the chamber. Luckily for you they like to play with their food first, so do your best to out-hop them in boss chase style levels!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADDITIONAL GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Character sprites presented with hand-drawn frame-by-frame animation.<br></li><li>View some rooms in 90 degree rotations to get a better view of the environment.<br></li><li>Avoid and endure 20+ obstacles, 5+ enemies, and puzzle/mini-games.<br></li><li>6 different chambers with 2-3 levels each, all with different themes to explore.<br></li><li>Visual novel-style cutscenes of a bizarre and kinky story.<br></li><li>Multiple endings to unlock depending on your actions throughout the game.</li></ul>",
